/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (I am a 23-year-old Urban and Regional Planning student at Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember \(ITS\) with a passion for social interaction and exploring new opportunities. Known for my extroverted nature, strong critical thinking, collaborative spirit, and high self-esteem, I thrive in dynamic environments. I have strong skills in spatial analysis, remote sensing, and urban modeling, and I am proficient in tools such as ArcGIS, Google Earth Engine \(GEE\), and GeoSOS-FLUS. I use these tools to support land use modeling, urban planning strategies, and transportation analysis. My academic background is reinforced by hands-on experience in managing spatial data and conducting geospatial analysis to address urban challenges. I was also awarded 3rd place in a national-level GIS Analyst Infographic Competition organized by Universitas Pendidikan Indonesia, demonstrating my ability to merge technical expertise with effective visual communication.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
