1394 0 obj
<<
/Title (This study maps the morphology of Bromo Tengger Semeru National Park using DEM-derived elevation and slope data. Results show that over 75% of the area is dominated by steep and moderately steep terrain, shaped by volcanic activity around Mount Semeru and Bromo. These findings provide essential insights for conservation planning, disaster risk mitigation, and sustainable land management.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1392 0 R
/Next 1395 0 R
>>
